{title: Nothing but the Blood}
{artist: Robert Lowry}
{genre: Gospel}
{flow: Response}
{style: Traditional}
{key: F}
{tempo: 84}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
What can [F]wash away my sin?
[C7]Nothing but the blood of [F]Jesus
What can [F]make me whole again?
[C7]Nothing but the blood of [F]Jesus
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Oh! [F]precious is the [Bb]flow
That [F]makes me white as [C7]snow
No [F]other fount I [Dm]know
[C7]Nothing but the blood of [F]Jesus
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
For my [F]pardon this I see
[C7]Nothing but the blood of [F]Jesus
For my [F]cleansing this my plea
[C7]Nothing but the blood of [F]Jesus
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Nothing [F]can for sin atone
[C7]Nothing but the blood of [F]Jesus
Naught of [F]good that I have done
[C7]Nothing but the blood of [F]Jesus
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
This is [F]all my hope and peace
[C7]Nothing but the blood of [F]Jesus
This is [F]all my righteousness
[C7]Nothing but the blood of [F]Jesus
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
